# S06: e1m1's Quad Damage turning in its secret corridor (the item at 544,2480,-88).
# Classic at 320x200, no status bar; Classic steps the turn on id's 72 Hz ticks. The move
# is eased over file seconds 1 to 3.2; the handles hold.
#
# Under V3-03: "It went online. People rebuilt it, raced through it, and competed in it."

map e1m1

duration 4.2
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8

camera path
key 1    544,2380,-66  5,90  ease inout
key 3.2  520,2390,-66  5,80

events on
